How did a man even get here? Who cares?

115
00:04:54,400 --> 00:04:56,237
Let's just go and catch the bastards!

116
00:04:56,320 --> 00:04:57,150
Right.

117
00:05:06,760 --> 00:05:08,980
Get off of me, you stupid snakes!

118
00:05:10,940 --> 00:05:12,397
What kind of snakes are these?

119
