They feel like they're made of iron!

120
00:05:13,980 --> 00:05:15,557
It seems luck is against us.

121
00:05:15,640 --> 00:05:19,457
Let's just hope they skip the
interrogation and kill him right away.

122
00:05:19,540 --> 00:05:22,364
But they'll kill him no
matter what, won't they?

123
00:05:22,580 --> 00:05:23,897
It's with this country.

124
