now. Specifically,

126
00:05:45,740 --> 00:05:49,057
I would like to know how you got onto
this island and what you want here.

127
00:05:49,140 --> 00:05:49,970
I don't know.

128
00:05:50,053 --> 00:05:51,457
I'm just as confused as you.

129
00:05:51,540 --> 00:05:55,777
I got sent flying through the sky, and
the next thing I knew, I landed here.

130
00:05:55,860 --> 00:05:56,919
An unlikely story.

131
00:05:57,120 --> 00:06:00,757
Lying to me will only guarantee you
an excruciatingly painful death.

132
00:06:00,840 --> 00:06:02,797
You're here because you want something.

133
00:06:02,880 --> 00:06:05,115
Well, yeah, I could really use a ship.

134
