Actually, it'd be better if you guys
could just give me a lift, though.

135
00:06:08,820 --> 00:06:12,057
Either way, I'm in a pretty big hurry,
and I need to get going right away.

136
00:06:12,140 --> 00:06:13,997
You are the boss around here, right, lady?

137
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:15,280
So help me out.

138
00:06:15,400 --> 00:06:17,877
Who does this disrespectful
pup think he is?

139
00:06:17,960 --> 00:06:19,377
The snake princess is right.

140
00:06:19,460 --> 00:06:22,284
That story is clearly an
impossible fabrication.

141
00:06:22,440 --> 00:06:23,417
Don't listen to him.

142
00:06:23,500 --> 00:06:24,817
He's plotting something.

143
00:06:24,900 --> 00:06:26,240
You can't deceive us.

144
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:30,620
We can get back up and keep fighting.

145
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:46,317
The only way that you will
leave this island is by dying,

146
00:06:46,400 --> 00:06:48,224
and your departure is imminent.

147
00:06:52,060 --> 00:06:54,354
Please, Snake Princess, he's not lying!

148
00:07:04,260 --> 00:07:05,777
I know how this must sound,

149
00:07:05,860 --> 00:07:09,337
but I don't believe this man is the
kind of person who can tell a lie.

150
00:07:09,420 --> 00:07:10,479
What is she doing?

151
00:07:11,100 --> 00:07:12,977
I believe he's telling the truth.

152
00:07:13,060 --> 00:07:16,457
This man is incapable of anything
but a childlike sincerity.

153
00:07:16,540 --> 00:07:20,952
I honestly don't think he would ever
try to inflict any harm upon our land.

154
00:07:21,100 --> 00:07:22,600
Hey, thanks, buddy.

155
00:07:22,900 --> 00:07:24,877
I knew you didn't really want to kill me.

156
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:26,877
You're one of our warriors, aren't you?

157
00:07:26,960 --> 00:07:28,057
Yes, my name is Margaret.

158
00:07:28,140 --> 00:07:31,357
Given that men are forbidden
here under penalty of death,

159
00:07:31,440 --> 00:07:34,417
he sealed his fate the moment
he arrived in our land.

160
00:07:34,500 --> 00:07:35,640
Why defend him?

161
00:07:36,440 --> 00:07:38,558
Because I share the burden of guilt.

162
00:07:39,400 --> 00:07:43,400
The person who brought him here and
who allowed him into the city...

163
00:07:44,500 --> 00:07:45,520
It was me!

164
00:07:47,020 --> 00:07:47,920
Margaret, no!

165
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:49,160
You can't!

166
00:07:53,440 --> 00:07:54,322
Snake Princess!

167
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:55,817
Please, steal your fury!

168
00:07:55,900 --> 00:07:57,820
It was not her fault! It's true!

169
00:07:58,140 --> 00:08:01,497
We found him knocked out and the
floor is totally covered in mushrooms.

170
00:08:01,580 --> 00:08:04,337
We thought he was one of us,
so we brought him back here.

171
00:08:04,420 --> 00:08:06,240
Sweet Pea, Afalandra.

172
00:08:06,440 --> 00:08:08,017
We're just as guilty as Margaret,

173
00:08:08,100 --> 00:08:10,397
but under all those mushrooms,
we just couldn't tell.

174
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:12,037
It was an honest mistake, Empress.

175
00:08:12,120 --> 00:08:13,597
Stop it, I won't let you do this.

176
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:16,717
I'm the one who said we should bring
him back to the village, not you.

177
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:18,437
Does she realize what she's doing?

178
00:08:18,520 --> 00:08:21,755
She's trying to be honest,
but she's just being stupid.

179
00:08:24,020 --> 00:08:25,337
You guys are all right.

180
00:08:25,420 --> 00:08:30,185
You were trying to kill me back there,
but now I see you're actually pretty nice.

181
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:37,337
I bear the sole responsibility for
bringing the man here, Empress.

182
00:08:37,420 --> 00:08:38,420
Please, Margaret!

183
00:08:39,140 --> 00:08:40,100
It's all right.

184
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:44,280
Now lift your head,
honest little Margaret.

185
