punished for their transgression?

197
00:09:21,900 --> 00:09:23,380
Then it's my fault!

198
00:09:24,820 --> 00:09:25,650
Wait!

199
00:09:25,733 --> 00:09:27,386
Turn them back to normal now!

200
00:09:30,860 --> 00:09:33,840
I believe it's time to
release Bekori. Bekori?

201
00:09:34,060 --> 00:09:36,717
The man's already dead and
he doesn't even know it!

202
00:09:36,800 --> 00:09:38,540
I told you to turn them back!

203
00:09:38,660 --> 00:09:41,542
This is the female warrior
nation of Amazon Lily.

204
00:09:41,880 --> 00:09:44,337
Here, strength is regarded as true beauty.

205
00:09:44,420 --> 00:09:46,657
Show us what little
strength you may possess,

206
00:09:46,740 --> 00:09:49,799
and be grateful that I've
given you death in battle.

207
00:09:55,520 --> 00:09:58,226
Behind you stands the
panther known as Bekori.

208
00:09:58,500 --> 00:10:03,441
The beast has served as the official
executioner of Amazon Lily for generations now.

209
00:10:03,800 --> 00:10:07,960
When it's done, there won't be a
single bone left to remember you by.

210
00:10:09,300 --> 00:10:11,120
All I care about is them!

211
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:12,620
Turn them back now!

212
00:10:12,920 --> 00:10:16,217
Did you hear how that savage was
speaking to the snake princess?

213
00:10:16,300 --> 00:10:17,888
Ceremonic from Lynn Bekori!

214
00:10:20,420 --> 00:10:22,340
Now, Baccarat!

215
00:10:54,560 --> 00:10:58,200
He's strong, he just knocked
Bekori out with a single blow.

216
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:02,037
And he didn't even use any Haki!

217
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:04,337
That was just brute strength.

218
00:11:04,420 --> 00:11:06,714
What the hell is wrong with all of you?

219
00:11:08,460 --> 00:11:09,960
That woman up there.

220
00:11:11,700 --> 00:11:14,237
She turned three of your
own people into stone!

221
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:16,817
How can you just sit up
there and laugh like that?

222
00:11:16,900 --> 00:11:17,880
I never!

223
00:11:18,400 --> 00:11:21,540
That little savage has
the gall to shout at us!

224
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:22,777
Oh, don't lesser to him!

225
00:11:22,860 --> 00:11:24,036
He's just an animal!

226
00:11:24,280 --> 00:11:25,917
Sure, I feel sorry for those three,

227
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:28,837
but the Snake Princess had
every right to do what she did!

228
00:11:28,920 --> 00:11:29,750
Of course!

229
00:11:29,833 --> 00:11:30,720
It was justice!

230
00:11:30,980 --> 00:11:32,980
They violated the law of our land!

231
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:38,160
What you don't understand is that
I'll be forgiven for anything I do.

232
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,176
Absolutely anything.

233
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:44,320
And the reason why is
because I'm beautiful.

234
00:11:54,700 --> 00:11:55,840
Just look at me.

235
00:11:56,100 --> 00:11:57,512
I'm sure you must agree.

236
00:11:58,200 --> 00:11:59,788
Actually, you make me sick.

237
00:12:02,500 --> 00:12:03,860
Stay strong, sister.

238
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:06,242
This simply cannot be happening.

239
00:12:06,420 --> 00:12:08,937
There's no man alive that
can resist my allure.

240
00:12:09,020 --> 00:12:10,373
It's just not possible.

241
00:12:14,940 --> 00:12:18,777
So long as that man exists in this
world I shall never know peace again.

242
00:12:18,860 --> 00:12:21,437
How dare you hurt the
snake princess like that!

243
00:12:21,520 --> 00:12:23,557
Make the man suffer for his crimes.

244
00:12:23,640 --> 00:12:24,980
Execute him.

245
00:12:27,400 --> 00:12:28,520
Execute! Execute!

246
00:12:29,880 --> 00:12:33,560
Marigold, Sandersonia, defend
my honor and take his head

247
00:12:35,900 --> 00:12:37,020
Execute! Execute!

248
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:40,240
You got it We'll get
the job done, big sis.

249
00:12:48,520 --> 00:12:50,920
So these girls have powers, too.

250
00:12:56,880 --> 00:13:00,180
The sisters are about to
start their snake pit dance.

251
00:13:00,620 --> 00:13:03,860
I've never seen Mary Gold's
salamander move before.

252
00:13:04,160 --> 00:13:05,080
I can't wait.

253
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:10,820
Ooh, don't forget about
Sandersonia's egg-headed serpent!

254
00:13:15,800 --> 00:13:18,094
They look fabulous when they transform!

255
00:13:18,680 --> 00:13:19,717
Of course they do!

256
00:13:19,800 --> 00:13:21,597
It's proof that they've slain the Gorgon!

257
00:13:21,680 --> 00:13:24,977
They've got great looks and
power and must run in the family!

258
00:13:25,060 --> 00:13:26,340
What's a Gorgon?

259
00:13:26,520 --> 00:13:28,638
Is there something I'm missing here?

260
00:13:28,920 --> 00:13:31,802
Just looks like they've
eaten devil fruits to me!

261
